# Compatibility note
#
# The canonical local environment template is the repo-root .env.example.
# For new setups, copy ..\..\.env.example to ..\..\.env and maintain Vite
# values there.
#
# App-local .env files are deprecated compatibility fallback only:
# - OS/process environment variables override both files.
# - Repo-root .env overrides app-local .env.
# - App-local .env may fill only keys missing from OS env and repo-root .env.
